stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Disabled
  Disabled --> Standby: User enables + permissions available
  Standby --> WakeDetected: Supported wake word
  WakeDetected --> VerifyOwner
  VerifyOwner --> Standby: Denied / timeout
  VerifyOwner --> Recognize: Verified
  Recognize --> Clarify: Missing slots
  Clarify --> Recognize: User replies
  Recognize --> Authorize: Typed intent complete
  Authorize --> Confirm: Risk policy requires
  Confirm --> Execute: Approved
  Authorize --> Execute: Approved no confirmation
  Confirm --> Standby: Cancel / timeout
  Execute --> Report
  Report --> Standby
  Standby --> Disabled: User disables
  Standby --> Blocked: OS / role / permission unavailable
  Blocked --> Standby: User restores access
